content.p:
The objectives of the proposed methodological assessment are to assess: (a) the diverse conceptualization of values of nature and its benefits, including biodiversity and ecosystem services (provisioning, regulating and cultural) consistent with the Platform’s conceptual framework;
Decision IPBES-2/4, annex. (b) the diverse valuation methodologies and approaches; (c) the different approaches that acknowledge, bridge and integrate the diverse values and valuation methodologies for policy and decision-making support; and (d) knowledge and data gaps and uncertainties.
Using the Platform’s confidence framework in the Platform’s guide on assessments (IPBES/4/INF/9).
